WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.110
I'm looking forward to that DVD
we're planning to watch today.

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:05.440
Me, too.

00:00:07.730 --> 00:00:10.950
Come to think of it, the person who
sits at this desk hasn't come to school.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:14.120
Oh, you mean Armin? He really hates the cold,

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:16.120
so he never comes to school during the winter.

00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:17.290
It's already spring.

00:00:17.490 --> 00:00:19.620
Just how much does he hate the cold?

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:22.120
But he should come to school soon.

00:00:22.330 --> 00:00:24.790
Yeah. Why don't we go check on him after school?

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.460
Hey, you lot!

00:00:26.670 --> 00:00:28.130
Mr. Keith!

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:31.380
You guys are the only ones
who haven't joined any clubs yet.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:35.350
Club activities, huh? If there's a club
where all you do is beat up Titans,

00:00:35.550 --> 00:00:37.390
I'd join in a heartbeat.

00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:39.350
That's just like you, Eren.

00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.310
Eren Jaeger!

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.310
Sir!

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:45.440
You and Armin Arlelt went to the
same elementary school, didn't you?

00:00:45.650 --> 00:00:46.230
Yes, sir!

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:50.360
Go collect the club admission form
from him by tomorrow.

00:00:50.570 --> 00:00:55.280
If you fail, I'll put him and the whole
lot of you into whatever club I choose.

00:00:55.490 --> 00:00:56.950
Got that?

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:31.250
Period 2
Chasing! Titan Junior High School

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.590
Thanks!

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:33.760
"Sweet Drink"

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:35.590
Meat buns and <i>amazake</i>.

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.390
This should be enough to get Armin to come out.

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:46.810
Hello!

00:02:51.770 --> 00:02:53.280
He took the meat buns!

00:02:53.480 --> 00:02:54.320
You bastard!

00:02:54.530 --> 00:02:55.780
Wait, Eren!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:59.910
Give my meat buns back, you damn Titan!

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:02.620
Dammit! Let go of me, you damn Titan!

00:03:02.830 --> 00:03:04.700
Take my iron fist!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:10.210
If this continues, the meat buns will get cold.

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:14.590
Eren!

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:20.510
Who's that?

00:03:25.720 --> 00:03:27.480
That's...

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:31.560
...the wings... of freedom.

00:03:31.770 --> 00:03:34.520
That uniform...
He's an upperclassman at Attack Junior High?

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:35.730
What?

00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.030
Hey, you kids.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.290
What exactly is going on here?

00:03:45.490 --> 00:03:49.920
I've decided, Mikasa!
I'm gonna join whatever club he's in!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.420
I'll train there and get stronger
in order to fight the Titans!

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.130
I will, too.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.010
Mikasa! You don't need to.

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:02.180
You said yourself that we
should stay away from Titans!

00:04:02.390 --> 00:04:03.350
Yes.

00:04:03.550 --> 00:04:06.600
That's why I'm doing it; so <i>you</i> won't die.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.140
All right.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:12.270
Hey. Answer the damn question, you twit.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:15.150
Sir! Which club do you belong to?!

00:04:15.360 --> 00:04:17.360
That's none of your concern.

00:04:17.570 --> 00:04:18.570
What?

00:04:26.620 --> 00:04:27.990
That's Armin's grandpa.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.920
Tsk. Old geezer... Don't beat the futon!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.670
You should use the futon beater
as if you're sliding it to the side.

00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:35.920
- Otherwise you'll damage the batting inside.

00:04:35.920 --> 00:04:36.750
- Whoa! What're you doing?! Stop it!

00:04:36.750 --> 00:04:37.880
- Give me that!

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.300
I'll teach you how to use the futon beater!

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.840
Let's go see Armin.

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.720
- Yep.
- Look at this! Your technique is completely wrong!

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:45.640
Armin

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:47.180
Armin! Open the door.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:47.850
Armin

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:50.230
There's something we want to give you.
Open the door.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:50.430
Armin

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.350
I can't!

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:57.110
There's no way I can survive...
in this hellish cold.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:58.530
It's already spring!

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:01.740
No, it's not. It hasn't <i>become</i> spring.

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:04.110
I was just mistaken until now.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.490
This world has always been winter,
from the very start.

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:09.290
The Siberian cold air mass
and a low pressure system...

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:12.910
A typical winter weather pattern;
high pressure in the west, low in the east.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.370
What's he going on about?

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.080
Armin, listen.

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:17.960
We've got meat buns and <i>amazake</i>.

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:19.920
"Armin"

00:05:19.920 --> 00:05:20.210
Really?!

00:05:21.460 --> 00:05:24.180
Ahhh... This makes it nice and warm, huh?

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.770
Hey, Armin...

00:05:30.970 --> 00:05:32.230
Doesn't that make you feel hot?

00:05:32.430 --> 00:05:33.980
Not really.

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:38.940
Mikasa, wouldn't you feel a bit cooler
if you took off that thing on your neck?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:43.110
I'm okay. But more importantly,
we should get some fresh air in here.

00:05:43.320 --> 00:05:47.280
I can't. I feel cold these days
even when I'm wrapped in my futon.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:50.830
That's understandable.
It's getting thin since it has a tear in it.

00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:51.620
What?

00:05:51.830 --> 00:05:52.870
You're right!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.460
Maybe you should buy a new one?

00:05:55.670 --> 00:06:00.300
I can't! This futon has been with me
ever since I was a little kid,

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.010
so it's like a part of me!

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:05.970
No other futon would...

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:08.350
- You are...!
- Wh-Wh-Wh-What on earth is going on?!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:10.720
Tsk. Give me that!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.220
My futon!

00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:14.230
We'll follow him, Mikasa.

00:06:14.430 --> 00:06:15.480
Got it!

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:17.980
Wait for me!

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.360
We lost him.

00:06:21.570 --> 00:06:23.440
What am I gonna do?

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:26.150
That futon is precious to me.

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:30.160
Be it a cold day or a cool one,
that futon wrapped me in its warmth.

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:32.370
Without it, I'll...

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:35.160
Wear this for now.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.500
Thanks.

00:06:36.710 --> 00:06:40.040
But where should we start looking for him?

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:43.090
Eren, look.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:45.340
That's...

00:06:46.420 --> 00:06:48.890
...a button from the back of his jacket!

00:06:49.090 --> 00:06:51.890
If we ask around at school,
we may be able to find out something.

00:06:52.100 --> 00:06:53.260
Yeah!

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:54.020
Let's go!

00:06:54.220 --> 00:06:55.430
- Okay.
- Okay!

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.990
What's the matter, guys?!
Don't tell me Titans attacked you!

00:07:08.910 --> 00:07:12.080
I thought I could eat as much
as I wanted if I joined the Cooking Club!

00:07:12.280 --> 00:07:14.950
So you snacked on all the ingredients...

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:18.160
Since I have close-cropped hair,
I was asked to join the Baseball Club, but...

00:07:18.370 --> 00:07:20.630
Isn't that bat for the Titans?

00:07:20.830 --> 00:07:23.210
The Soccer Club I checked out
was a disaster, too.

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:26.550
It's more like a game
of pushball than soccer, huh?

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:29.590
Dammit! What's with this school?!

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:32.760
The other clubs are like that, too.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.680
Reiner...

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:37.020
My Judo Club and
Ymir and Christa's Brass Band Club

00:07:37.230 --> 00:07:39.060
were terrible because of Titans, too.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:40.270
Humph!

00:07:42.360 --> 00:07:43.730
Hey, who's that?

00:07:43.940 --> 00:07:47.030
Oh, he's Armin, the guy who's
been absent from school all this time.

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.280
I-I'm Armin Arlel—

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.280
A-Are you okay?

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.330
That's one serious sneeze attack.

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:55.700
Are you okay?

00:07:55.910 --> 00:07:59.960
He catches cold when he's
not wrapping himself in his futon.

00:08:00.170 --> 00:08:03.420
Oh, that's right.
Have you guys seen this before?

00:08:03.630 --> 00:08:06.250
It belongs to someone who
defeated a Titan with one blow

00:08:06.460 --> 00:08:07.880
and took Armin's futon.

00:08:08.090 --> 00:08:10.930
Defeated a Titan? What the heck?

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:14.050
Wait. I've heard about it.

00:08:14.260 --> 00:08:18.310
It's said that in this school,
there's a shadowy secret organization

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.890
that rebels against the Titans
under the flag of the wings of freedom.

00:08:21.100 --> 00:08:24.110
A club where all you do is beat up Titans?!

00:08:24.310 --> 00:08:25.900
Eren looks happy.

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:29.490
My futon may be there, too.

00:08:29.690 --> 00:08:30.950
That's not all.

00:08:31.150 --> 00:08:35.200
They say that the strongest man
in the human race is in that club.

00:08:35.410 --> 00:08:39.120
The strongest man... in the human race?

00:08:39.330 --> 00:08:42.460
"The strongest man"...
That sounds kinda cool!

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:46.460
If we join that club, do you think
we can keep our lunch safe from Titans?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:49.960
If I defeat Titans looking all cool,
I might become popular among girls, huh?

00:08:50.170 --> 00:08:52.510
What's the name of that club?!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:56.220
Hey, hey, this is a secret organization
we're talking about here.

00:08:56.430 --> 00:08:58.680
There's no way that we can find it so eas—

00:09:00.140 --> 00:09:02.980
Attack Junior High Scout Regiment?

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:04.810
That wasn't hard to find.

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:07.610
I did hear that it was a secret organization.

00:09:07.820 --> 00:09:10.240
They're advertising quite openly.

00:09:10.240 --> 00:09:10.280
<b>The Scouts'
Main Base
of Operations
Join and
become part of our
shadowy organization!</b>

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:10.490
<b>Join and
become part of our
shadowy organization!
The Scouts'
Main Base
of Operations</b>

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:13.240
This is just like a secret base
elementary kids would set up.

00:09:13.240 --> 00:09:13.450
<b>Join and
become part of our
shadowy organization!
The Scouts'
Main Base
of Operations</b>

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.280
I'm getting a bit worried.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.160
What're you guys saying?!

00:09:17.370 --> 00:09:19.990
The strongest man in the human race
is in this club, right?

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:23.540
We'd better get a grip on ourselves,
or who knows what'll happen to us, too!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:25.540
Quiet, you brats!

00:09:27.170 --> 00:09:31.130
Don't tell me you came here knowing
we're a shadowy secret organization,

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:34.470
the only group in this school
that rebels against Titans...

00:09:34.680 --> 00:09:35.970
It really exists!

00:09:36.180 --> 00:09:37.890
No, that can't be right.

00:09:38.100 --> 00:09:39.810
Operations at the
Attack Junior High Scout Regiment

00:09:40.010 --> 00:09:41.560
are kept hidden from the school.

00:09:41.770 --> 00:09:44.230
Not to mention, Year 1 brats wouldn't...

00:09:44.440 --> 00:09:46.440
He's telling us the entire so-called secret.

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:47.690
That is pretty fishy.

00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:48.400
In any case, please let us come in!

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.860
<b>The Scouts'
Main Base
of Operations</b>

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.780
We're looking for our friend's futon.
Please let us in.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:57.700
What's your problem?!
What makes you think that

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.740
a shadowy secret organization
would let strangers in so easi—

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.380
Oruo!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:10.840
What happened? Was it an assassin?!

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:13.720
Cutting his tongue? How cruel!

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:15.800
We're now marked by the school!

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.510
Excuse me...

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:21.680
...but he smacked himself
with the door and bit his tongue.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:30.060
Come to think of it, Oruo bites
his tongue about three times a day.

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:32.650
I wish he had bitten his tongue off and died.

00:10:32.860 --> 00:10:34.570
Petra! That was a terrible thing to say!

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.240
All this happened because
these brats suddenly showed up

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.030
and demanded me to let them in.

00:10:39.240 --> 00:10:41.830
What can you do? They're Year 1 students.

00:10:42.950 --> 00:10:43.910
Humph!

00:10:44.120 --> 00:10:47.670
It's true that we're a shadowy
organization that operates in secret.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:52.000
Of course Year 1 students couldn't
have possibly made an appointment.

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:53.050
- They may even do absurd things like using a futon as an excuse to join us.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:55.470
- I'm Petra. Nice to meet you.

00:10:55.470 --> 00:10:59.090
- Do you guys really want to join the Attack Junior High Scout Regiment?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:00.050
Yes!

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:05.520
Oh, that's one reason, but we're
looking for the owner of this button.

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:11.940
Hange!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:16.110
Miche! Welcome back!

00:11:16.320 --> 00:11:19.450
Hi guys! Check this out!

00:11:19.660 --> 00:11:22.080
I found some Titan
fingernail clippings in the trash

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:25.240
so I brought them back
for you guys as souvenirs!

00:11:25.450 --> 00:11:28.210
Hm? There seems to be a lot
of kids that I don't know in here.

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:30.460
They're Year 1 students.
They came to check out the Scouts

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:31.960
because they want to join us!

00:11:32.170 --> 00:11:36.760
Are you serious?! To think that
this many kids want to join us...!

00:11:36.960 --> 00:11:37.300
Wha...?!

00:11:37.510 --> 00:11:42.100
I bet you want to join us because
you're interested in stuff like this, right?

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:43.810
Not in the least.

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:45.970
You don't have to hide it!

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:48.430
You want to dismember their bodies
to have a full understanding of them!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:51.900
You want to join us because you have
that sort of love towards Titans, right?!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.150
You're acting like a psycho!

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:57.440
- What's with this place? This is like a nest of weirdos.
- What do you do with those Titans' fingernails?

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:59.280
- What's with this place? This is like a nest of weirdos.
- Hey, stop. Don't ask Hange questions!

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:00.530
But...

00:12:00.740 --> 00:12:03.950
- ...this is a group of people who seek change.
- Oh, I knew it. I thought you looked like you wanted to ask me about it.

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:06.950
- This is, indeed, the Attack Junior High Scout Regiment.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.250
Th-The person who took my futon should be he—

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:12.830
Futon?

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:16.920
Come to think of it, Levi was walking
with a futon earlier, right, Miche?

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.260
Please call this Levi person in!

00:12:19.470 --> 00:12:22.550
Oh, if that's what you want, then...
Here you go.

00:12:22.760 --> 00:12:23.800
An empty plastic bottle?

00:12:24.010 --> 00:12:26.720
Well then, let's do it!

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:28.220
Ah, okay.

00:12:30.470 --> 00:12:31.770
<b>Combustibles</b>

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:34.860
Eren!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:37.940
Hey, brat. Don't mix plastic bottles
in with combustibles.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:39.690
You're supposed to ditch them
in the recycle bin.

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:43.030
Hey, Levi! Your slap
is in excellent form, as usual!

00:12:43.240 --> 00:12:46.030
Just as we'd expect from the
strongest man in the human race!

00:12:47.580 --> 00:12:49.200
Shut up, Abnormal.

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:53.210
I knew it. This person <i>is</i> the
strongest man in the human race.

00:12:53.420 --> 00:12:54.790
That's my futon!

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:56.090
Please give it bac—

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.000
Why did you tak—

00:12:59.090 --> 00:13:01.340
That's obvious.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:05.050
You don't need a reason
to repair a damaged futon!

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.390
He's stopped sneezing!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.060
To think that you caught a cold
just because your futon was gone...

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:17.570
Can't you keep your body in good shape?

00:13:17.770 --> 00:13:21.070
Ahhh... This is warmer than before.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.860
If you put that futon on, maybe you
can come to school starting tomorrow.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.110
Yeah, you should do that!

00:13:25.320 --> 00:13:26.910
I'm happy for you, Armin.

00:13:27.120 --> 00:13:29.330
Yep! Thanks, everyone!

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:31.080
Levi!

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:33.830
Please let me join the Scouts!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:35.630
Before that...

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:38.040
...we need to clean this place up.

00:13:38.250 --> 00:13:40.250
We'll get on it right away.

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:45.550
Now, you want to join the Scouts?

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:48.300
Yes! Please consider it!

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:51.680
Do you know what it means to join the Scouts?

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:54.980
If the school finds out, you can be expelled.

00:13:55.190 --> 00:13:58.400
Have you come here prepared for that?

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.270
We came here prepared!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.940
He's right!
A grudge over food is truly fearsome!

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:05.150
Give me back the fried chicken my mom made!

00:14:05.360 --> 00:14:08.950
Hey, chee-burg bastard, what about you?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.790
Answer the damn question, you twit.

00:14:13.410 --> 00:14:15.500
I...

00:14:15.710 --> 00:14:21.050
I want to join the Scouts...
and slaughter every Titan I can!

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.380
I see... Not bad.

00:14:29.140 --> 00:14:30.970
What're you doing?!

00:14:31.640 --> 00:14:32.560
<b>Approved</b>

00:14:32.560 --> 00:14:33.600
Whoa!
<b>Approved</b>

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:34.350
Whoa!

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:38.730
You're in. I'll make you guys
all members of the Scouts.

00:14:38.940 --> 00:14:40.570
Is this cool or what?!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:42.820
Just as you'd expect
from a shadowy organization.

00:14:43.030 --> 00:14:46.280
Now we are members of the Scouts, too!

00:14:46.490 --> 00:14:48.070
We already...

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.410
...belong to different clubs, though.

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:57.710
<b>Wall Cleanup Club</b>

00:14:57.710 --> 00:14:59.790
W-Wall Cleanup Club?!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.670
Why?! We did submit our
club admission form, didn't we?!

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:07.630
Our club is unauthorized.
What makes you think that they would accept it?

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.930
Idiots.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.720
Nooooooo!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:22.440
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>climb over that wall</i>

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:28.200
<i>Like a lighthouse, ignite the light of hope</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:33.700
<i>That enormous strength is precisely</i>
<i>what leads the way to freedom</i>

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:39.420
<i>Let's look beyond this conflict, Ausfall!</i>

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.510
<i>Inside the wall, with no place to run,</i>

00:15:54.720 --> 00:16:00.190
<i>we're stuck in restrictions and exploits</i>

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:04.730
<i>Even if our glory days of youth</i>
<i>get trampled upon,</i>

00:16:04.940 --> 00:16:10.360
<i>I want to at least hold on to the future</i>

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:16.240
<i>I won't give in to that</i>
<i>absurd scolding voice, either</i>

00:16:16.450 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I pledged to the earth that I'd make</i>
<i>our dreams and hopes come true</i>

00:16:22.170 --> 00:16:27.340
<i>The time to fight back has come,</i>
<i>the blood in my veins calls forth the future</i>

00:16:27.550 --> 00:16:33.140
<i>We'll pull apart all those troublesome rules</i>

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:38.600
<i>Now's the time to raise the flag</i>
<i>of revolt upon that steep wall</i>

00:16:38.810 --> 00:16:44.230
<i>Seek prosperity, Ausfall!</i>

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:49.280
"I'll crush you."

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:54.120
Annie vows to get revenge with Eren
and plays in a ball game tournament.

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:56.990
At the end of the battle, Eren comes to
realize the reason for that deep hatred.

00:16:56.990 --> 00:17:00.000
Dodgeball! Titan Junior High School
